{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"109510","name":"Acropolis Museum Boutique","description":"The family-friendly hotel is nestled at the foot of the Acropolis hill, just a few steps away from the Parthenon, the Temple of Zeus, Hadrian Arch and other monuments of Ancient Greek civilisation. Sitting in the very heart of the city's historic centre allow its guests to reach the Constitution Square, the Greek Parliament, Athens stock market and Athens' exclusive shopping areas of Ermou and Kolonaki within a short walk. Guests who want to explore the rest of the city can find the nearest metro station just 400 metres away, while those who are looking for something off the beaten path can visit the nearby Monastiraki flea market. The hotel is housed in a classical building that dates back to 1928 and which has undergone complete renovation in order to turn it into a modern and comfortable establishment.","address":"Sygrou Avenue, 48","city":"ATHENS","countryCode":"GR","postalCode":"11742","lat":37.966059,"lng":23.728434,"stars":3,"giataCode":"129503","phone":"+302109249050","email":"info@acropolismuseumhotel.com","website":"www.acropolismuseumhotel.com","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/10/109510/109510a_hb_a_005.jpg","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/10/109510/109510a_hb_a_003.jpg","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/10/109510/109510a_hb_l_001.jpg","category":"lobby","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/10/109510/109510a_hb_l_002.jpg","category":"lobby","order":3},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/10/109510/109510a_hb_l_004.jpg","category":"lobby","order":4},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/10/109510/109510a_hb_l_003.jpg","category":"lobby","order":5},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/10/109510/109510a_hb_l_005.jpg","category":"lobby","order":6},{"url":"https://photos.hote